# The definite article. Accusative singular "το" (neuter) and "τη"/"την"
# (feminine) are cited to Wiktionary: "το", neuter nominative/accusative
# singular of "ο" (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/το); "τη", feminine
# accusative singular of "ο", used before a word that does not start with a
# vowel or a plosive consonant (κ ξ π τ ψ γκ ντ μπ) -- "την" is the
# alternative form used otherwise (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/τη).
ο
η
το
οι
τα
τον
την
τη
